cument_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1220811011:0":{"text":"물약이 완성되었어요. 어서 딸에게 약을 먹이세요. 따님이 약을 먹으면 금방 나을 거예요.","source_cn":"药水做好了。这位夫人，赶快让你女儿服下药水吧。直觉告诉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC59F8A75BA64CB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1220811012:1":{"text":"네… 지금 바로 약을 먹일게요!","source_cn":"好，好……我这就把药喂给她！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54FD1B7FA3F3AAC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:22:1220811013:0":{"text":"물약을 마신 소녀의 통증은 금방 완화되었다.","source_cn":"服下药水之后，小女孩的疼痛果然得到了缓解……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC40450C504FEFC08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1220811014:1":{"text":"아가, 어떠니? 아직도 아프니?","source_cn":"宝贝，你感觉怎么样？身上还疼不疼？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE23F810ED495C42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1220811015:1":{"text":"음… 전보다 많이 좋아졌어요. \n일어서도… 아프지 않아요!","source_cn":"唔……比之前好多了。\\n就算站起来……也不疼了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF322C34FB14EFFEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","doc